Lodizal Shell Shield Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Lodizal Shell Shield Quest","wikiPath":"/Lodizal_Shell_Shield_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Cobalt Scar","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Bungre Crawcrusher","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Section of Lodizal's Shell","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Section_of_Lodizal%27s_Shell"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Lodizal Shell Shield","item":"Lodizal Shell Shield","wikiPath":"/Lodizal_Shell_Shield"}],"card":{"title":"Lodizal Shell Shield Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 50","Classes: Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Rogue, Shadow Knight, Shaman, Warrior","Related Zones: Iceclad Ocean","Related NPCs: Lodizal","Required Faction: Apprehensive or better"]},"links":["Cobalt Scar","Bungre Crawcrusher","Bard","Cleric","Druid","Paladin","Ranger","Rogue","Shadow Knight","Shaman","Warrior","Iceclad Ocean","Lodizal","Lodizal Shell Shield","Enduring Breath","Section of Lodizal's Shell","Othmir","Ulthork"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Bungre Crawcrusher","text":"What manner of creature are you, strange one? I can see that you are not native to any nearby territories. Your thin flesh and lack of hair would mean certain death when the ice queen breathes upon these seas."},{"npc":"Bungre Crawcrusher","text":"I have heard not of your kind but you are welcome to take refuge on our beaches, we only ask that you help to defend them should the predators choose to attack."},{"npc":"Bungre Crawcrusher","text":"There are many dangerous predators that prowl the surrounding oceans and cliffs. It is my duty to train pups to become strong warriors in order to defend our villages. The wyverns on the cliffs prey primarily on the wounded and sick as well as many creatures that live in the brackish waters of our bay. The deadliest predators are the ones that roam all the coasts preying not only on my people but the Snowfangs and the Ulthork as well. Kelorek'Dar and Lodizal are the most feared of all."},{"npc":"Bungre Crawcrusher","text":"Lodizal is a giant carnivorous sea turtle that roams the iceclad ocean preying primarily on the Snowfang gnolls. The Snowfang gnolls are not trusted by we Othmir as they survive on the skins and meat of walrus and otter but Lodizal is a threat to all coastal dwellers. Should Lodizal ever be slain I would be willing to craft a shield from his shell and adorn it with Othmir runes. I would charge ten thousand gold for the service."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T07:37:55.669Z","outOfEra":true}
