Talym Shoontar's Head	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Talym Shoontar's Head","wikiPath":"/Talym_Shoontar's_Head","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Surefall Glade","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Hager Sureshot","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Tailored Large Bag","item":"Tailored Large Bag","wikiPath":"/Tailored_Large_Bag"},{"text":"Faction, Experience, Small Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Talym Shoontar's Head","lines":["Minimum Level: 20","Classes: All","Related Zones: Surefall Glade, East Freeport, Qeynos Hills","Related NPCs: Talym Shoontar"]},"links":["Surefall Glade","Hager Sureshot","East Freeport","Qeynos Hills","Talym Shoontar","Tailored Large Bag","Faction","Mammoth","Guards of Qeynos","Karana Residents","Knights of Thunder","Priests of Life","Protectors of Pine","Jaggedpine Treefolk","Sabertooths of Blackburrow","Hunting Bow"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"Greetings, ______. Feel free to rest here in Surefall Glade. Just be sure you do no hunting whilst here. If so, then you shall pay the punishment of death. I trust you [will abide by the laws]?"},{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"That is wise. Your health, for now, is assured. A plague of hunters has infested our land heavily in recent weeks. The word is out that [Mammoth] still lives. Hunters have flocked here in search of a trophy or profit and glory. Instead, they find the deadly accuracy of my arrows."},{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"Mammoth is the great bear of the caves. [Tunare] has blessed our home with Mammoth's presence. It is said that when the great bear dies, so too shall the Jaggedpine. He would be quite a trophy to some hunter. And quite profitable to a poacher. Even the infamous [Talym Shoontar] has tried his hand at the hunt."},{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"Talym Shoontar is a poacher. He has eluded us for quite some time. He has organized parties of poachers to plague our forest as well as others. He hails from Halas, but I have heard he now calls the Plains of Karana home. I have placed a bounty upon his head. Do you [wish to collect the bounty]?"},{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"That's the spirit!! Spoken like a true Protector of the Pine! Last I heard, Talym Shoontar was hunting in the Plains of Karana. He has also been spotted running to and from Qeynos. No doubt he is selling hides to some merchant. End his life of hunting. Bring me his head to collect the bounty."},{"npc":"Hager Sureshot","text":"His days of hunting are over. In the name of the Protectors of the Pine, I offer you this reward. If you are unable to make use of it, you may sell it. I suggest you hold onto it. If you are a ranger it will come in handy."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:32.853Z","outOfEra":false}
Duster Models	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Duster Models","wikiPath":"/Duster_Models","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Ak'Anon","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Drekon Vebnebber","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Bootstrutter's Framed Pack","item":"Bootstrutter's Framed Pack","wikiPath":"/Bootstrutter%27s_Framed_Pack"},{"text":"Forging Hammer","item":"Forging Hammer","wikiPath":"/Forging_Hammer"}],"card":{"title":"Duster Models","lines":["Minimum Level: 6","Classes: All","Related Zones: None","Related NPCs: Duster V, Duster X, Sanfyrd Featherhead"]},"links":["Ak'Anon","Drekon Vebnebber","Duster V","Duster X","Sanfyrd Featherhead","Bootstrutter's Framed Pack","Forging Hammer","Series C Black Boxes","Daily Log","Gem Choppers","Merchants of AkAnon","King AkAnon","Dark Reflection","Clan Grikbar","Scrubber IV","Cleaner X","Steamfont Mountains","Scrap Metal","Red V Clockwork","Eldritch Collective","Meldrath"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Drekon Vebnebber","text":"Oh my!! It seems two of the obsolete duster models were not fully shut down. You must find them. They could be anywhere in Ak'Anon!! After you destroy them, take their scraps to Sanfyrd Montop. He is the operator of the scrapyard."},{"npc":"Duster V","text":"Click.. Dust. Dust. Dust."},{"npc":"Duster X","text":"Click.. Dust. Dust. Dust."},{"npc":"Sanfyrd Featherhead","text":"Greetings! I am the operator of this scrapyard. If you have any scrap metal, I would be glad to purchase it from you in loads of four. The Gemchoppers no longer allow me to accept blackbox fragments and micro servos."},{"npc":"Sanfyrd Featherhead","text":"I hear there is one more on the loose. Find him and then I shall pay you."},{"npc":"Sanfyrd Featherhead","text":"Good. The citizens of Ak'Anon are safe from these little critters. They may have injured someone; that is why they were deactivated. Here is something I found in the scrapyard. I hope you can find a purpose for it."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:33.947Z","outOfEra":false}
Gem Inlaid Gauntlets Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Gem Inlaid Gauntlets Quest","wikiPath":"/Gem_Inlaid_Gauntlets_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"North Qeynos","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Umvera Dekash","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Gem Inlaid Gauntlets","item":"Gem Inlaid Gauntlets","wikiPath":"/Gem_Inlaid_Gauntlets"}],"card":{"title":"Gem Inlaid Gauntlets Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 30+","Classes: All","Related Zones: Butcherblock Mountains, Freeport, Splitpaw Lair, Southern Karana","Related NPCs: Durkis Battlemore, Jheron Felkis, a Tesch Mas Gnoll"]},"links":["Qeynos","Umvera Dekash","Butcherblock Mountains","Freeport","Splitpaw Lair","Southern Karana","Durkis Battlemore","Jheron Felkis","A Tesch Mas Gnoll","Gem Inlaid Gauntlets","Tanned Split Paw Skin (lore)","Tesch Val Compilation","Pawbook"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"What, _____? Do I look like a merchant to you? Just because all these merchants are in my library, it doesn't mean that I am one. If you are interested in something other than spell scrolls, then, we can talk."},{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"Ah, so you do have half a wit about you! Very well. As you can clearly see, I am the librarian here. I keep track of all of the mystic tomes that enter this divine building. I also take care of all of the purchasing. Have you something to offer?"},{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"Excellent! You have no idea how difficult it is to get good help these days. Do you think you would have the time to gather some information for me?"},{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"Even better! Well, it has been some time since the Tesch Val gnolls moved in on the Split Paw. That being said, we still know little to nothing of their origins. If you can bring me back the four scrolls that our diviners speak of, I believe I can reward you well."},{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"It's about time. Let's see here. Right.. right.. right. Very good. Right. There you are! I translated the text. Now the scrolls need to be bound. Take these scrolls to Jheron Felkis in Freeport. I believe he is staying in one of the spare rooms in Velith and Bardo's establishment. He will ensure they are bound correctly. Return to me when the binding is complete."},{"npc":"Jheron Felkis","text":"Ah, yes - the splitpawbook. Umvera sent word that you should be arriving, you certainly made your way here quickly! Very well, then, one moment as I work my magic..."},{"npc":"Jheron Felkis","text":"Good, good - here you are! Take this back to Umvera, I'm sure he'll be happy to lay eyes on such an item of lore!"},{"npc":"Jheron Felkis","text":"Greetings, Wood Elf. My name is Jheron Felkis, artificer and friend to all those who seek knowledge of the arcane!"},{"npc":"Umvera Dekash","text":"You have returned safely. That is wonderful! Where the heck is my book, child? In my hands, I see. Such a bright little twinkle you are! Well, let me scribble something down on this pad here. There you are. Take this note to Durkis Battlemore in the Butcherblock Mountains. He is a remarkable smith, but more importantly, he owes me for his smithing books."},{"npc":"Durkis Battlemore","text":"What have ye got there, lad? Ack. I thought I would never hear from that crazy old man again. He wants me to give you a pair o' me gauntlets. I suppose I kin do that. Here you are, Southern. Wear them in good health."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:35.038Z","outOfEra":false}
Bandit Spectacles	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Bandit Spectacles","wikiPath":"/Bandit_Spectacles","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"South Qeynos","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Gehna Solbenya","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Spell: Center","item":"Center","wikiPath":"/Center"},{"text":"Spell: Endure Poison","item":"Endure Poison","wikiPath":"/Endure_Poison"}],"card":{"title":"Bandit Spectacles","lines":["Minimum Level: 10","Classes: All","Related Zones: Qeynos","Related NPCs: a bandit"]},"links":["Qeynos","Gehna Solbenya","A bandit","Center","Endure Poison","Spectacle"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Gehna Solbenya","text":"Greetings and blessings to you, _____. Karana offers you his protection and guidance. All who accept the offer shall find safe haven within our Temple of Thunder. If you are a cleric of Karana, you must have a [desire to serve Karana]'s flock."},{"npc":"Gehna Solbenya","text":"If you are a young acolyte, you may [deliver blessings to the flock] and if you are a skilled cleric, we need you to [hunt bandit binders]."},{"npc":"Gehna Solbenya","text":"Go to the Plains of Karana and seek out the Karana Bandits. Among them can be found their bandit binders. They are healers of sorts. Which evil deity granted them this power is unknown to us. Each carries a binder spectacle. I shall reward clerics for every two returned spectacles. Perhaps a new power may even be bestowed."},{"npc":"Gehna Solbenya","text":"The bounty will not be paid until two spectacles are received."},{"npc":"Gehna Solbenya","text":"Excellent work. These foul men have no right to be proficient in the ways of healing. Here then is your bounty. Use it in your continued war against the Karana bandits."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:36.124Z","outOfEra":false}
