Plane of Mischief Faction Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Plane of Mischief Faction Quest","wikiPath":"/Plane_of_Mischief_Faction_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Plane of Mischief","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Debbis the Fish","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"}],"card":{"title":"Plane of Mischief Faction Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 55","Classes: All","Related NPCs: Stomples, Vinny V. D`vicci"]},"links":["Plane of Mischief","Debbis the Fish","Stomples","Vinny V. D`vicci","Faction","A Rabbit Foot","Denizens of Mischief","Lucky Skunk Foot"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Debbis the Fish","text":"Oh wow! A rabbits foot!! Thank you so much. Here take this, I won't need this smelly thing any more."},{"npc":"Vinny V D`vicci","text":"What? You think I's fishin here to amooze you? Yooz think I'm tha entertainment? I ain't da god who owns this here joint, so's I can't make no farkin hail. Go bother the Pod people kid."},{"npc":"Vinny V D`vicci","text":"Nice work kid. Now I'm feelin lucky. So's ya say ya wanna learn about cards right? Lemme tell ya. Them cards are nice but lets have some REAL fun. Yer resourceful, I like that. What say we take over this joint fer ourselves? Ol' Bristle's gettin soft, ya know? Wadda ya say? Man or mouse?"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T09:49:16.338Z","outOfEra":true}
